  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 oPt Emergency Appeal - West Bank - Education in Emergencies and Mental Health and Psychosocial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNRWA&#x2019;s EiE programme will address learning loss and trauma among children in violence-affected areas by providing transportation for 766 children and teachers to access schools safely, strengthening emergency preparedness in 43 schools through trauma kits, safety measures, and post-incursion repairs, and implementing two catch-up programmes in core subjects for 22,500 students most impacted by closures. The Agency will offer individual and group counselling to 19,819 students and 1,500 education personnel, engage 15,000 vulnerable students in winter and summer camps, and enhance MHPSS integration in classrooms by training teachers in relevant practices.</narrative>
  </description>
